oid enemies or save allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/5c9aaa9d2243d48573c3b64b4a640197.avif?t=1772711939\" width=628 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/743f14485aaaf449a23f7c73d4c9c616.poster.avif?t=1772711939\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/743f14485aaaf449a23f7c73d4c9c616.webm?t=1772711939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/743f14485aaaf449a23f7c73d4c9c616.mp4?t=1772711939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every region poses a unique tactical puzzle of Astrals and their minions. Plan your path carefully, as liberated lands grant rewards, but the Astral army gains the powers of those you\u2019ve defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/37a144fad2cde815a75294df75a2b74f.avif?t=1772711939\" width=628 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/30f2fc10a74f113045c573fdfcede62e.poster.avif?t=1772711939\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/30f2fc10a74f113045c573fdfcede62e.webm?t=1772711939\" type=\"